  "notes": "C1b with the caption pass (X16, agent PR #439): the production-v4-captions profile (experiment_captions inline, max_caption_calls 30, 13,000 tokens per caption call) on the experiment agent for Nano and Super, 25 dev clips each. Gated: the profile is sent only when the run's approval marker lists it in enabled_profiles, which the lead does after the base64 probe; this config needs its own approval. budget_mode hard_stop: the run-wide token caps sum to 9 M tokens (inference 1.5 M, grounding 2 M, zoom 3.5 M, caption 2 M). chunking.enabled varies per clip (false for a clip of 30 s or less) and is recorded per run, never pinned.",
  "purpose": "pilot",
  "budget_mode": "hard_stop"
}
